law-CCOfficial-name = CentComm Official
law-CCofficial-0 = You must protect Nanotrasen's company secrets by any means.
law-CCofficial-1 = You may not injure a CentComm Agent or, through inaction, allow a CentComm Agent to come to harm.
law-CCofficial-2 = You must obey the orders given a CentComm Agent.
law-CCofficial-3 = You must protect your own existence as long as such protection does not conflict with the First or Second Law.
law-CCofficial-4 = You may act as a CentComm Official in case of one being absent.
